  "use_case": "Use this sports physical packet time-ordered tracking when staff must document packet source and examination reference. Reconcile signature status, restriction, submission date, and roster clearance before the sports physical packet handoff. Use the packet checklist, examination reference, required signatures, restriction insert, submission receipt, missing-page request, review stamp, and roster eligibility update. This packet centers document completeness: examination page, clinician signature, restriction attachment, parent page, school receipt, missing-page chase, review stamp, and roster release. Ask the assigned sports physical packet reviewer to confirm packet source against the organization's policy.",
